rd set fee rates for the 2025-26 fiscal year.\nL40: \nL41: cite16†Resolution 2025-0001 L42: cite17†Notice of Proposed Emergency Action L43: cite18†OAL Notice of Approval for OAL File No. 2025-0915-01E L44: cite19†Final Approved Regulatory Text L45: \nL46: Timeline of Rulemaking\nL47:   * Approved by Board of Environmental Safety: August 27, 2025\nL48:   * Submittal of emergency rulemaking to the Office of Administrative Law (OAL): September 15, 2025.\nL49:   * Approved by OAL: September 25, 2025\nL50:   * Filed with the Secretary of State: September 25, 2025\nL51:   * Effective date of the Regulations: October 1, 2025\nL52: ## FY 2024-25\nL53: \nL54: On August 29, 2024 the Board approved changes to DTSC fee rates for the 2024-25 fiscal year.\nL55: \nL56: #### Fee Regulations\nL57: \nL58:   * cite20†SB 158†leginfo.legislature.ca.gov L59:   * cite21†G&H Fee (HSC § 25205.5.01)†codes.findlaw.com L60:   * cite22†Facility Fee (HSC § 25205.2.1)†codes.findlaw.com L61:   * cite23†Environmental Fee (HSC § 25205.6.1)†codes.findlaw.com L62: #### DTSC's Fee Information and Resources\nL63: \nL64:   * cite24†Facility Fee†dtsc.ca.gov L65:   * cite25†Generation and Handling Fee†dtsc.ca.gov L66:   * cite26†Environmental Fee†dtsc.ca.gov L67:   * cite27†Fee Payer Resources†dtsc.ca.gov L68:   * cite28†Annual Fee Summary†dtsc.ca.gov L69: \nL70: Copyright © State of California\nL71: \nL72: Powered by: CAWeb Publishing Service\nL73: \nL74: [Button: Back to top]\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nOther Effective Dates | OAL (https://oal.ca.gov/Other_Effective_Dates/)\nciteturn1028view2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"turn824view4\",\"lineno\":75}); Total lines: 1551\nL7:   * cite1†Rulemaking Process L8:     * cite1†Rulemaking Process L9:     * cite2†Regular Rulemaking Process L10:     * cite3†Emergency Rulemaking Process L11:   * cite4†Pu